00:16:12.560 --> 00:16:14.660
Hey, Charlie, come on in and take a look.

00:16:14.760 --> 00:16:16.640
Feller in here has got a timetable.

00:16:17.600 --> 00:16:20.000
We ain't seen one of these in 20 years.

00:16:20.960 --> 00:16:23.340
Anybody want to help me and my daughter's tote the supplies?

00:16:23.480 --> 00:16:24.640
Why, just come right this way.

00:16:24.820 --> 00:16:25.980
Oh, hold it, hold it.

00:16:26.340 --> 00:16:28.900
This train's supposed to go to the end of the line, Pixley.

00:16:29.300 --> 00:16:29.980
As a matter of fact, we...

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:36.390
do there already so am i so let's get rolling what seems to be the trouble here floyd fella

00:16:36.390 --> 00:16:41.710
here wants to go on to the end of the line right away says it's a schedule is that a fact what do

00:16:41.710 --> 00:16:48.180
you think we ought to do well i reckon the fair thing to do is to put it to a vote a vote good idea

00:16:48.530 --> 00:16:55.310
all those in favor of going up to kate's cool comfortable shady rest hotel for some delicious

00:16:55.310 --> 00:16:59.730
fried chicken and apple pie served by her three beautiful daughters.

00:17:00.060 --> 00:17:01.180
Hold up your right hand.

00:17:01.400 --> 00:17:02.120
Come in.

00:17:02.320 --> 00:17:03.900
Here's to me you're outvoted.

00:17:18.060 --> 00:17:18.540
Kitchen.

00:17:19.280 --> 00:17:20.520
Connie Floyd, show them the way.

00:17:20.840 --> 00:17:22.020
I appreciate this very much.

00:17:22.120 --> 00:17:22.960
Just set it down in the kitchen.

00:17:25.620 --> 00:17:28.400
Oh, man.

00:17:29.130 --> 00:17:29.970
Uncle Joe found...

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:38.000
